  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...11...14 spirit. All non-spirit foes knocked down within its range are knocked down for at least 3 seconds. Whenever this happens, this spirit loses 50...30...25 Health. This spirit dies after 15...39...45 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造等級 1～14 的大地縛靈，範圍內的敵人一旦被擊倒，倒地效果將持續至少 3 秒。而當此效果發生時，縛靈失去 50～25 體力。大地縛靈將在 15～45 秒後消失。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...8...10 spirit. All non-spirit foes knocked down within its range are knocked down for at least 3 seconds. Whenever this happens, this spirit loses 50...30...25 Health. This spirit dies after 15...39...45 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "召喚等級 1～10 的靈體，持續 15～45 秒。範圍內非靈體敵人被擊倒時，倒地時間至少 3 秒；每次觸發，靈體失去 50～25 體力。"
    }
  },
